threshold should be ~0.35 in any system with drift-selection dynamics.
\item \strong{The step wins on AIC.} A Heaviside model should outperform both
sigmoid and logistic on properly resolved economic disruption data.
\item \strong{Option value collapses as a step, not exponential.} The standard
